WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:08.791
Welcome back, coders! Today you will put a loop inside a loop to make amazing pattern art.

2
00:00:09.391 --> 00:00:12.800
The inner loop draws one square.

3
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:19.252
The outer loop repeats the whole square and turns a little each time.

4
00:00:19.252 --> 00:00:22.661
This is called a nested loop.

5
00:00:23.261 --> 00:00:28.409
Multiply to find how many times the inside blocks run.

6
00:00:28.409 --> 00:00:38.774
An outer loop of 8 and an inner loop of 4 means the move block runs 8 × 4 = 32 times!

7
00:00:39.374 --> 00:00:44.957
Use “set pen color” and “set pen size” before you draw.

8
00:00:44.957 --> 00:00:50.974
Change the colour inside the outer loop to make a rainbow pattern.

9
00:00:51.574 --> 00:00:58.461
To spread shapes evenly around a circle, divide 360 by the number of shapes.

10
00:00:58.461 --> 00:01:03.174
8 squares → turn 45 degrees after each one.

11
00:01:03.774 --> 00:01:07.617
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

12
00:01:07.617 --> 00:01:12.765
Now build along, then try the challenges. You’ve got this!
